@WebApplication1_HostAddress = https://localhost:7292

### Get all tickets

GET {{WebApplication1_HostAddress}}/api/tickets
Accept: application/json


### Update ticket number 1 - should return 200

PUT {{WebApplication1_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Street light is still broken",
  "description": "The street light has not worked for three days.",
  "category": 0,
  "priority": "Urgent"
}


### Update ticket that does not exist - should return 404

PUT {{WebApplication1_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/9999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Unknown ticket",
  "description": "This ticket does not exist.",
  "category": 0,
  "priority": "High"
}


### Exercise 6 - Get all tickets
GET {{WebApplication1_HostAddress}}/api/tickets
Accept: application/json


### Exercise 6 - Filter by status number
### 1 = InProgress
GET {{WebApplication1_HostAddress}}/api/tickets?status=1
Accept: application/json


### Exercise 6 - Filter by category number
### 0 = Infrastructure
GET {{WebApplication1_HostAddress}}/api/tickets?category=0
Accept: application/json


### Exercise 6 - Filter by both
GET {{WebApplication1_HostAddress}}/api/tickets?status=1&category=0
Accept: application/json


### Exercise 6 - Filter using enum name
GET {{WebApplication1_HostAddress}}/api/tickets?status=Open
Accept: application/json


### Exercise 6 - Invalid status
### Expected: 400 Bad Request
GET {{WebApplication1_HostAddress}}/api/tickets?status=Banana
Accept: application/json